'''Living in the Light''' is [[Dogma]]'s boss theme. This song is unique among the game's [[music]], being that it's accompanied by a full English narration, which is performed by Matthias Bossi and Jon Evans of [[RIDICULON]]. It should be noted that the first phase of the fight contains no narration, however.
It should also be noted that the OST version of the song plays its vocals in a different order from the in-game version. Below are the lyrics as they appear in the game's OST.

