== Trivia ==
* The vocals/singer can be heard in the mini-cutscene before fighting Dogma and the cutscene that plays prior to fighting [[The Beast]].
* The bible verses spoken are from either The New Living or New International Version and are 1 John 1:7-9, Matthew 12:31, Colossians 3:5-6, 1 Corinthians 10:13, Galatians 5:20-21, Romans 6:23, Isaiah 64:6, and Romans 12:9.
* This, along with Hush (Jesus Loves Uke) ''(end credits)'', are the only songs in-game that have lyrics. Other songs have repeating words, but only these have unique lines.

